    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Stand as One.</strong> When an ally within 5 feet of you is subjected to an effect that would push or pull it, you can take a Reaction to prevent that ally from being pushed or pulled. The ally can’t benefit from this if it has the Incapacitated condition.</p><p><strong>Vigilant.</strong> When you take the Ready action, the next attack roll made against you before the start of your next turn has Disadvantage.</p>",
